# 🚀 Flask Application — AWS ECS Fargate CI/CD

A production-style **Flask application deployment on AWS ECS Fargate** using **GitHub Actions, OIDC authentication, Amazon ECR, Application Load Balancer, and Amazon CloudWatch**.

This project demonstrates a secure, automated, containerized CI/CD pipeline where code changes pushed to GitHub are automatically built, containerized, pushed to Amazon ECR, and deployed to ECS Fargate.

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```text
                         ┌──────────────┐
                         │   Developer  │
                         └──────┬───────┘
                                │
                                │ Push Code
                                ▼
                         ┌──────────────┐
                         │    GitHub    │
                         └──────┬───────┘
                                │
                                │ Trigger Workflow
                                ▼
                    ┌────────────────────────┐
                    │    GitHub Actions      │
                    │                        │
                    │ Build Docker Image     │
                    │ Authenticate via OIDC  │
                    └───────┬─────────┬──────┘
                            │         │
                         OIDC│         │ Push Image
                            ▼         ▼
                     ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────────┐
                     │ AWS IAM  │  │ Amazon ECR   │
                     │          │  │              │
                     │ Federated│  │ Docker Image │
                     │ Access   │  │ Repository   │
                     └──────────┘  └──────┬───────┘
                                          │
                                          │ Pull Image
                                          ▼
                                  ┌────────────────┐
                                  │  ECS Fargate   │
                                  │                │
