## 🌐 Application Traffic Flow

```text
Internet
   │
   ▼
Application Load Balancer
   │
   ▼
ECS Fargate Service
   │
   ▼
Flask Container
   │
   ├── GET /
   │
   └── GET /health
```

The ALB provides a stable entry point while ECS manages the underlying container tasks.

